'''Fortunate Freezing''' is a passive event that can happen in the {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}.

== Mechanics ==
During the '''Fortunate Freezing''' event, players gain {{stat|mnf|2}} for every {{stat|cold|-1}} they have.

